<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.00 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.00 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.00 percent in the week ended May 17 from 6.04 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   May 17, 1997  May 10, 1997  May 18, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.00	   +6.04	   +4.42</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  323.3	   322.8	   305.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended May 18, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
